---
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Swiped Out — Free Webinar | Marcus Levine"
	description="Free 45-minute live session: how dating apps keep you single — and what actually works. Register to save your spot."
>
	<div class="stack gap-20">
		<main class="wrapper stack gap-10 register">
			<Hero
				title="Swiped Out"
				tagline="How Dating Apps Keep You Single — and What Actually Works"
			>
				<p class="eyebrow">Free 45-minute live session</p>
			</Hero>

			<section class="content stack gap-4">
				<p class="datetime">[Date] · [Time] CET · live on video</p>
				<ul>
					<li>what the apps genuinely do well — and the two things they can't (and won't) do for you</li>
					<li>why that leaves in-person, and the body response and two old stories that have made it feel impossible</li>
					<li>the one honest question that expresses interest without cornering anyone — plus a challenge to practise it this week</li>
				</ul>
				<p>
					This isn't pickup, and it's not about becoming someone you're not — the opposite.
					You'll learn to show interest honestly, without being creepy, because honesty is the
					whole antidote to creepy.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="form-wrap">
				<form method="POST" action="https://api.web3forms.com/submit" id="form" class="register-form">
					<input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="71cc3900-9ab4-4d85-af03-f5628a7daa3b" />
					<input type="hidden" name="subject" value="Webinar registration — Swiped Out" />

					<div class="form-group">
						<label for="name">Name</label>
						<input type="text" name="name" id="name" required placeholder="Your name" />
					</div>
					<div class="form-group">
						<label for="email">Email</label>
						<input type="email" name="email" id="email" required placeholder="your@email.com" />
					</div>
					<button type="submit" class="submit-button">Save my spot →</button>
					<p class="under-form">Come nervous. That's the point.</p>
					<p class="tiny">
						Register and I'll send you my field note, <a href="/swiper-no-swiping/"><em>Swiper, No Swiping</em></a> —
						the numbers on why the apps are rigged against the average man, and the game most people stopped playing.
					</p>
					<div id="result" class="form-result"></div>
				</form>
			</section>
		</main>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.register {
		padding-top: 2rem;
		max-width: 48rem;
	}

	.eyebrow {
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
		letter-spacing: 0.16em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--accent-regular);
		font-weight: 600;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.content {
		font-size: var(--text-md);
		color: var(--gray-200);
	}

	.datetime {
		text-align: center;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--gray-0);
	}

	.content ul {
		padding-inline-start: 1.25rem;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.5rem;
	}

	.form-wrap {
		width: 100%;
	}

	.register-form {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1.25rem;
		background: var(--gray-999_40);
		border: 1px solid var(--gray-800);
		border-radius: 1.5rem;
		padding: 2rem;
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
	}

	.form-group {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.4rem;
	}

	label {
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--gray-100);
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
	}

	input {
		font: inherit;
		padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--gray-700);
		border-radius: 0.75rem;
		background: var(--gray-999);
		color: var(--gray-0);
	}

	input:focus {
		outline: 2px solid var(--accent-regular);
		border-color: transparent;
	}

	.submit-button {
		font: inherit;
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: var(--text-lg);
		color: var(--accent-text-over);
		background: var(--gradient-accent-orange);
		border: none;
		border-radius: 999rem;
		padding: 0.9rem 2rem;
		cursor: pointer;
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
	}

	.submit-button:hover {
		filter: brightness(1.05);
	}

	.under-form {
		text-align: center;
		color: var(--gray-300);
		font-style: italic;
	}

	.tiny {
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
		color: var(--gray-400);
		text-align: center;
	}
</style>
